Watch the approaching car on your phone screen in real time! As the car drives toward you, you'll see the pickup time, the driver's photo, and their personal rating.

Main features of the application:

Mark a point on the map, no need to write a long address with l;

- Preliminary calculation of the Gzinti circle;

- Search for a car considering the tariff and your wishes (child seat, receipt, etc.);

- The application shows detailed information about the driver and his car;

- The driver's movement is visible on the map;

- Leave an opinion about the quality of the service after the tour;

- Save popular addresses and select them quickly;

- The sound signal will inform about the arrival of the car;

Purchase history. Repeat the order. Gary Kayitmak.


